            },
            "formats": [
              "heading"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "#### A. Le procédé Mond (pour purifier le Nickel - $\\text{Ni}$)",
            "start": 1999,
            "end": 2062
          },
          {
            "id": "p24",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **Étape 1 :** On fait réagir du nickel impur avec du monoxyde de carbone ($\\text{CO}$) vers 50-60 °C. Cela donne du tétracarbonyle de nickel, un gaz :",
            "start": 2063,
            "end": 2215
          },
          {
            "id": "p25",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  $$\\text{Ni (solide impur)} + 4\\text{CO (gaz)} \\xrightarrow{50-60^\\circ\\text{C}} \\text{Ni(CO)}_4 \\text{ (gaz)}$$",
            "start": 2216,
            "end": 2329
          },
          {
            "id": "p26",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  *(Les impuretés restent solides au fond).*",
            "start": 2330,
            "end": 2374
          },
          {
            "id": "p27",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **Étape 2 :** On chauffe ce gaz vers 200 °C. Il se décompose :",
            "start": 2375,
            "end": 2439
          },
          {
            "id": "p28",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  $$\\text{Ni(CO)}_4 \\text{ (gaz)} \\xrightarrow{200^\\circ\\text{C}} \\text{Ni (solide pur)} + 4\\text{CO (gaz)}$$",
            "start": 2440,
            "end": 2549
          },
          {
            "id": "p29",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "  *Et voilà, on obtient du nickel pur à 99,9 % !*",
            "start": 2550,
            "end": 2599
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
